      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-06-14T17:27:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I think it's crazy to put tokens on every ship as it comes out. There can be far too many ships out and moving them is way harder. It's far more manageable to only add chits as the values change (your ship panel being the only exception)</p>",
